Dora and the Lost City of Gold is a 2019 American adventure comedy film directed by
James Bobin and written by Nicholas Stoller and Matthew Robinson.

12
00:53:13,043 --> 00:53:19,043
Loosely based on the animated television series, it is the first
feature film in the Dora the Explorer franchise.

13
00:57:39,130 --> 00:57:45,130
It stars Isabela Moner, Eugenio Derbez, Michael Peña and Eva
Longoria, with Danny Trejo as the voice of Boots.

14
